  "worked_solution": "Using the method of polynomial division, we obtain the following:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-7x+4 \\\\  & 2{x}^{2}-5x+3\\,\\enclose{longdiv}{\\,\\,-14{x}^{3}+43{x}^{2}-50x+17\\,\\,} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{\\,\\,-14{x}^{3}+35{x}^{2}-21x}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,8{x}^{2}-29x+17 \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,{8{x}^{2}-20x+12}_{\u2015} \\\\  & \\,\\,\\,\\,\\,-9x+5\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n- the quotient is $-7x+4,$ and\n\n- the remainder is $-9x+5.$",
